  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "ba4d20eb-47c0-4585-ab4b-45b6c4055f06",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em portugues.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "442db9d6-5bdb-4d83-b306-d2e4cfc8b50a",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e acompanhe a frase.</p><p><strong>A la mayoría del grupo le apetece quedar temprano.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>A maioria do grupo está a fim de se encontrar cedo.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/21bcf646385345c6ba8fdb10c748f12d_b01-grupo-planeando-encuentro-temprano.png?Expires=1794099708&Signature=OG2IXNJB7Sy8l~Yau8XbXUP03EBse8w3qILCGuWgoY3qSWI13P1avv48GQr3o0qs0gamQkVoPSCPMBIReYS8SQ9tKOmJubvW~KA8Jg4HHxYp2Mhfy8CErAX52nvadD7LLtuGOMOfHusg5AUotSg1ktycM6YXSeG9S87dshGmucxBhRhTegCuu3ClXaHApRR91hZyayMGB0ZkpVkHvreiwVbuKjm~siXKWEN839jqOGp~EPMApRpr3qngXZnHDGrsVrju~SzwvIcBFUidFpW7CbP6XDYtCjAY7DSLVquxvmuKe1ZpTL6j4pQ7JUJ-oyv1BVxly2z~5vUfMDbztbaOhA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/88abd7df632549a1ad92b04b6c69c620_b01-a-la-mayoria-del-grupo-le-apetece-quedar-temprano.mp3?Expires=1794099708&Signature=Vog2A80dhuLRueP-NvYBOLNpKk9-U058McqRrhRf9DbyAbAh2r~lQ4RGfhf83R0Q6JYJ3tnHUOFezwWGFzwsmlj9Sebrk00K9cdlIhuyiJBFv4wE52p43dLIRjGMckBo2PYlOKiGFijQ82CrkQcGmx2w8bGpuDSWALe0YxqDSE8EfhLbQZGdZL7gQFtw25rTUjT4w-GXts1kEEjTTi6~LWl~gLlk-31r92iqaEEYy97Lw-zFc5~3P3KYQ7suja3WGJ8OKWLcMHwnluRE6eiBFAj6T-ezPWCMSt46WiVk2omMWQt9IEuIPEtkdkxEhWrGreBjYmyOQq3AkjHMAs8plw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
